WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:31.880 --> 01:33.010
It's done!

01:36.490 --> 01:37.760
Perfect!

01:40.390 --> 01:43.230
I got it, you want to have some too, Hiroshi?

01:43.800 --> 01:47.100
But you'll have to wait
until Pops gets home, okay?

01:48.700 --> 01:49.970
Right, good boy.

01:54.770 --> 01:56.670
I hope he comes home soon.

02:03.180 --> 02:04.750
Hello, Mikado residence.

02:05.580 --> 02:06.820
Oh, Pops!

02:08.020 --> 02:10.520
Oh, you can't come home today anymore?

02:11.660 --> 02:15.830
With the rough seas, the ferry
can't leave... that's too bad.

02:16.800 --> 02:18.100
Okay, got it. Bye!

02:27.370 --> 02:29.440
The green heart is a thing you give.

02:36.880 --> 02:38.280
Spider!

02:38.820 --> 02:41.650
Hey!! Get outta here!

02:43.590 --> 02:45.090
Thank you, Chocolat-chan.

02:45.560 --> 02:48.760
What am I supposed to do with you, getting
scared from a spider like that...

02:48.760 --> 02:50.190
It's cute!

02:50.530 --> 02:52.190
But it's scary...

02:54.070 --> 02:56.170
Vanilla-chan is scared of spiders.

02:56.170 --> 02:57.200
How cute...

02:57.200 --> 02:58.620
I want to protect her.

03:02.740 --> 03:04.140
Sugar Sugar Rune!

03:04.810 --> 03:05.910
Vani Rune!

03:08.450 --> 03:09.300
Wand!

03:10.580 --> 03:12.320
Heart, Heart, please come to me!

03:23.360 --> 03:24.260
I did it!

03:24.260 --> 03:27.770
Amazing, Vanilla.
Another three orange hearts.

03:29.130 --> 03:30.440
Thanks to Mr. Spider.

03:33.510 --> 03:35.470
I've got to do it too.

03:35.470 --> 03:38.680
I don't have time to let
my own heart come out!

03:41.480 --> 03:44.120
I've got to get a lot more hearts!

03:45.780 --> 03:50.560
But that black heart back then...
what was it, I wonder?

03:56.360 --> 03:58.860
Jeez, enough with the cleaning already!

03:58.860 --> 04:00.930
I've got to get me some hearts!

04:01.800 --> 04:02.830
Kato-san!

04:04.640 --> 04:08.010
I'm sorry, but could you take
this handout to Mikado-kun?

04:09.740 --> 04:11.040
You live near him, right?

04:11.440 --> 04:12.210
Please.

04:15.810 --> 04:17.350
Why me?

04:17.720 --> 04:20.550
Akira-kun stayed home today
because of a cold, right?

04:20.950 --> 04:22.320
I wonder if he's okay?

04:22.320 --> 04:26.590
Aw, he'll be fine. That guy ain't gonna
kick the bucket so easily.

04:27.030 --> 04:28.260
Chocolat-chan...

04:28.590 --> 04:32.560
Hey, if you're headin' to Akira's
place, we're comin' to.

04:33.930 --> 04:35.330
Right now his dad's overseas,

04:35.330 --> 04:39.460
so he doesn't have anyone to take
care of him while he's sick.

04:40.270 --> 04:43.690
Oh? Being sick all alone, how sad.

04:44.080 --> 04:44.880
That's it!

04:49.410 --> 04:52.000
Heh, heh... shopping is complete!

04:52.380 --> 04:54.350
Well, isn't this a surprise.

04:54.350 --> 04:58.290
Kato going this far for Akira's sake?

04:58.290 --> 05:01.030
Who knew she actually had a
feminine side somewhere?

05:03.390 --> 05:05.860
If I've got to go out of my way
to give him this handout,

05:05.860 --> 05:09.130
I might as well get Akira's
heart while I'm at it.

05:09.130 --> 05:10.760
Of course, my aim is pink.

05:17.980 --> 05:20.060
Huh? Is he not home?

05:20.910 --> 05:23.340
Maybe his fever got so bad,
he passed out?

05:23.980 --> 05:25.680
That might be it...

05:29.890 --> 05:32.590
Hey, Akira! You alive in there?!

05:37.000 --> 05:39.360
Maybe he really DID faint.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.000
No way...

05:41.800 --> 05:45.240
Hey! Hiroshi, did you come home?

05:46.800 --> 05:47.940
Akira!

05:47.940 --> 05:49.490
What the... oh, it's you guys.

05:50.040 --> 05:50.910
Hiroshi?

05:51.310 --> 05:53.140
Do you mean... that stupid dog?!

05:55.350 --> 05:57.480
Yeah, that stupid dog...

05:57.480 --> 05:58.750
Hey! Don't call him stupid!

06:01.550 --> 06:06.580
Actually, he hasn't come back since last night. I've been searching for him ever since.

06:07.690 --> 06:09.890
Speaking of which, Akira,
what about your cold?

06:10.500 --> 06:12.060
Just a fake illness.

06:12.060 --> 06:14.630
If I don't say something like that, I can't
stay home from school, you know.

06:18.140 --> 06:20.030
I see, so he wasn't sick at all.

06:20.810 --> 06:24.280
And I went to all the trouble to
buy this food to get his heart.

06:25.710 --> 06:28.820
In any case, I wonder where
Hiroshi-kun went off to?

06:29.810 --> 06:31.820
I... don't know.

06:32.520 --> 06:34.020
He's nowhere to be found.

06:34.590 --> 06:38.120
I searched all the places
he likes to take walks at.

06:38.120 --> 06:39.590
Could he have been abducted?

06:40.390 --> 06:42.710
It seems pet-napping has
gotten popular lately.

06:42.990 --> 06:47.000
No way! No one would take that dumb dog.

06:47.630 --> 06:52.370
Yeah, he's really clumsy, and
he can't do any tricks...

06:52.370 --> 06:53.840
Hey, stop distracting me!

06:55.940 --> 06:59.850
But he's so stupid,
he can't do anything without me.

07:02.850 --> 07:05.280
Well, I'm going to go search
for Hiroshi, see you later.

07:06.880 --> 07:08.250
Hey, wait, Akira!

07:08.250 --> 07:09.820
We'll help too!

07:12.920 --> 07:17.330
Ah, and I thought I finally had
a plan to get Akira's heart.

07:17.900 --> 07:18.700
That's it!

07:19.030 --> 07:21.670
What if you helped Akira-kun
search for Hiroshi-kun?

07:22.100 --> 07:25.400
If you find him, I bet Akira-kun
would be grateful.

07:26.670 --> 07:30.240
I'm sure the grateful feeling
would turn his heart pink.

07:30.740 --> 07:31.470
Don't you think?

07:32.980 --> 07:35.410
You can be pretty cunning
sometimes, Vanilla...

07:36.410 --> 07:37.010
Now, let's go.

07:37.620 --> 07:38.850
Hey, wait, Vanilla...

07:42.220 --> 07:44.360
Hey! Hiroshi!

07:45.190 --> 07:47.760
Where are you, where did you go?

07:48.230 --> 07:49.090
Akira...

07:50.400 --> 07:52.830
It's no use, he's not over this way.

07:52.830 --> 07:54.530
I'll look over by the trees.

07:54.870 --> 07:56.370
I'm sorry, you two.

07:56.370 --> 07:57.600
Don't worry about it.

07:58.170 --> 07:59.000
Let's go.

07:59.000 --> 07:59.500
Yeah.

08:03.710 --> 08:06.740
Hiroshi-kun, please respond...

08:07.810 --> 08:09.650
Hey, you dumb dog...

08:10.210 --> 08:11.480
Not here, I guess.

08:12.450 --> 08:13.650
Sorry about this, Kato.

08:13.650 --> 08:15.150
For having you come along with me.

08:15.150 --> 08:17.990
But I don't think he'd be in a trash can.

08:18.660 --> 08:19.270
Really?

08:20.020 --> 08:22.060
Then I wonder where he actually went?

08:23.060 --> 08:26.270
I wonder if he's hungry?

08:29.630 --> 08:33.370
Chocolat-chan, what if you used
magic to search for him?

08:33.370 --> 08:38.010
Eh?! I'm not able to use magic
to search for people...

08:38.010 --> 08:40.240
But he's just a dog.
You could do it somehow, right?

08:40.880 --> 08:42.310
You sure that's the problem?

08:42.310 --> 08:43.750
Just try it out.

08:44.220 --> 08:45.830
If you find Hiroshi-kun,

08:45.830 --> 08:50.840
with Akira-kun the way he is right now, that pink heart might even turn bright red!

08:51.660 --> 08:52.860
Red, huh?

09:01.200 --> 09:02.870
Sugar Sugar Rune!

09:02.870 --> 09:04.000
Choco Rune!

09:09.070 --> 09:09.790
Wand!

09:18.620 --> 09:19.480
Alright!

09:22.120 --> 09:23.520
Sugar Sugar Rune!

09:23.520 --> 09:24.660
Choco Rune!

09:28.330 --> 09:30.130
What's this?!

09:36.030 --> 09:37.900
Who are these people?

09:37.900 --> 09:38.870
I don't know...

09:39.640 --> 09:42.070
Hey, who are you guys?

09:42.740 --> 09:45.110
Who? I'm Hiroshi.

09:45.540 --> 09:47.080
I'm Hiroshi! Got a problem with that?

09:48.450 --> 09:50.350
So everyone is Hiroshi...

09:50.880 --> 09:52.270
Not the RIGHT Hiroshi, though...

09:53.080 --> 09:54.030
Kato!

09:54.890 --> 09:55.620
Akira.

09:56.050 --> 09:57.050
What's going on?

09:57.390 --> 09:58.560
Nothing much.

09:58.890 --> 10:00.260
Then, who are those people?

10:00.260 --> 10:01.030
Dunno.

10:02.030 --> 10:02.790
Akira!

10:03.690 --> 10:04.460
Mimura.

10:05.030 --> 10:05.860
Hiroshi's...

10:06.460 --> 10:07.550
Hiroshi's collar...

10:20.610 --> 10:21.810
It fell off here.

10:24.480 --> 10:26.550
So that's the dumb dog's collar?

10:27.320 --> 10:29.050
I mean, Hiroshi's collar?

10:29.890 --> 10:31.060
There's no mistake.

10:31.060 --> 10:35.590
Pops bought it in Spain, so I don't think any
other dog would have the same one.

10:36.290 --> 10:41.080
Just as you said, since Hiroshi is so clumsy,
he probably fell into the pond.

10:41.080 --> 10:43.230
What are you talking about?

10:43.230 --> 10:46.940
That doesn't make any sense.
Dogs can swim, you know.

10:46.940 --> 10:49.910
A dog wouldn't drown in a pond...

10:50.540 --> 10:52.410
For Hiroshi, it's possible.

10:52.410 --> 10:54.580
'Cause he's REALLY stupid!

10:58.620 --> 11:01.920
Disappeared as suddenly
as he appeared, it seems.

11:14.570 --> 11:18.900
Huh? That's strange, did I drop the key?

11:18.900 --> 11:22.340
Oh well, Pops said he'd
be home by six o'clock.

11:29.650 --> 11:31.250
Pops sure is late.

11:39.390 --> 11:41.430
What, you're cleaning me?

11:42.790 --> 11:45.430
Thanks, but you're the one that's soaked.

11:49.830 --> 11:51.270
Would you like to come along with me?

12:01.150 --> 12:03.980
Hiroshi's been with me ever since that day.

12:05.550 --> 12:08.190
Pops is a cameraman, see.

12:08.190 --> 12:11.950
He's been gone overseas
for half of the year,

12:11.950 --> 12:15.760
so Hiroshi's been the only family I've got with me.

12:17.090 --> 12:20.760
It's not just that he couldn't
do anything without me.

12:21.070 --> 12:22.000
Without him...

12:22.670 --> 12:26.010
Without him... if he weren't here,
I don't know what I'd do...

12:30.680 --> 12:31.540
Akira...

12:50.030 --> 12:53.460
Huh? You're making a
search party for Hiroshi?

12:53.460 --> 12:58.040
Yeah! Hiroshi can't be
dead yet, I'm sure of it!

12:58.500 --> 13:02.740
With everyone in the class helping out,
we'll search for him one more time.

13:11.450 --> 13:18.290
So therefore, we've already searched to the
west of town, and haven't found Hiroshi.

13:18.820 --> 13:24.300
This time I want to spread the search from
the east to the south, and to the north.

13:24.300 --> 13:26.730
Each person keep this in mind.

13:26.730 --> 13:28.130
Okay!

13:28.130 --> 13:30.330
Here are flyers to search for Hiroshi-kun.

13:32.290 --> 13:34.210
Whoa, those suck.

13:34.210 --> 13:36.410
They're so bad, no one will recognize him.

13:37.110 --> 13:39.340
Don't you have a better picture?

13:39.340 --> 13:43.250
Just a second, I'll go get
some better ones real quick.

13:46.080 --> 13:46.750
Kato...

13:48.620 --> 13:49.750
Will this do?

13:51.960 --> 13:53.790
Yeah, it's perfect.

13:56.890 --> 13:58.360
Sugar Sugar Rune!

13:58.360 --> 13:59.300
Choco Rune!

14:01.400 --> 14:03.930
Wow, all these pictures of Hiroshi-kun!

14:04.340 --> 14:06.340
I'm sure we can find him with these.

14:07.040 --> 14:09.010
I really want to find him.

14:09.670 --> 14:13.130
I've never seen Akira so sad...

14:14.550 --> 14:15.620
Chocolat-chan...

14:20.420 --> 14:22.050
Hiroshi!

14:32.700 --> 14:34.670
Do you remember seeing
the dog in this picture?

14:35.530 --> 14:36.870
Hiroshi!

14:42.240 --> 14:43.110
Everyone!

14:43.970 --> 14:44.940
How was it in your direction?

14:45.340 --> 14:47.140
No luck to the south.

14:47.140 --> 14:47.980
And you?

14:48.450 --> 14:50.070
No good, he's nowhere to be found.

14:50.950 --> 14:53.380
Even though we've searched this much,
we still haven't found him...

14:54.150 --> 14:55.840
In that pond...
maybe Hiroshi really did...

14:57.590 --> 14:58.330
Everyone!

14:58.820 --> 14:59.590
Akira.

15:00.290 --> 15:02.230
I'm sorry for keeping
everyone out at this hour.

15:03.190 --> 15:04.700
Don't worry about it.

15:04.700 --> 15:07.130
I'm sure Hiroshi's already...

15:16.670 --> 15:18.010
Sorry! I'm —

15:18.440 --> 15:20.060
Wait, Akira!

15:29.290 --> 15:30.220
Akira...

15:32.790 --> 15:33.410
Are you okay?

15:34.490 --> 15:36.760
Then you really had a fever...

15:36.760 --> 15:38.360
It's nothing, I'm fine...

15:38.860 --> 15:41.420
If Hiroshi's not there,
I couldn't sleep anyway.

15:42.400 --> 15:43.530
I couldn't do it.

15:44.340 --> 15:45.000
Hiroshi...

15:45.000 --> 15:45.920
Akira!

15:46.600 --> 15:49.810
If I could just see him once more...

15:50.640 --> 15:52.430
I want to be with him...

15:58.850 --> 16:02.350
Please, Vanilla, lend me your power.

16:02.850 --> 16:06.950
Combine our powers to let Akira
see Hiroshi one last time!

16:08.930 --> 16:10.460
Okay, I'll try my best.

16:14.930 --> 16:16.230
Sugar Sugar Rune!

16:16.570 --> 16:17.700
Choco Rune!

16:20.300 --> 16:21.170
Wand!

16:23.710 --> 16:25.180
Sugar Sugar Rune!

16:25.880 --> 16:26.940
Vani Rune!

16:28.950 --> 16:29.710
Wand!

16:50.600 --> 16:53.070
What the... ?!!

16:56.610 --> 16:57.740
What should we do?

16:58.210 --> 17:00.140
Did we screw up the spell?

17:00.620 --> 17:02.980
That's not what I wanted to happen!

17:02.980 --> 17:04.180
Wait, Chocolat-chan.

17:04.550 --> 17:07.080
If Hiroshi-kun already went to heaven...

17:07.790 --> 17:11.090
It's not like we sent
Akira-kun to heaven, right?

17:12.420 --> 17:13.990
Oh no!

17:13.990 --> 17:16.640
Akira, don't die!

17:19.130 --> 17:22.370
Perhaps, could it be...
the aliens are doing this!

17:43.890 --> 17:44.880
Akira!

17:46.920 --> 17:47.870
Pull yourself together!

17:52.500 --> 17:53.360
He's alive!

17:54.400 --> 17:57.760
Thank goodness, you didn't go to heaven.

17:58.140 --> 18:02.210
I'm so sorry, my crappy magic must
have shown you something scary,

18:02.540 --> 18:05.210
and I didn't even help you find Hiroshi...

18:09.750 --> 18:12.050
Huh? What happened?

18:12.820 --> 18:15.350
You came all this way
searching for Hiroshi.

18:15.350 --> 18:17.530
It was like I was flying or something...

18:18.890 --> 18:19.740
Then, Hiroshi is...

18:23.030 --> 18:24.190
I see.

18:24.190 --> 18:26.790
I'm sorry, I wasn't any help.

18:29.230 --> 18:30.800
I'm grateful.

18:31.240 --> 18:33.600
Everyone searched, and tried their best.

18:33.940 --> 18:35.010
Really, thank you.

18:36.840 --> 18:37.440
Huh?

18:53.660 --> 18:54.410
Hiroshi!

18:57.030 --> 18:57.900
Hiroshi!

18:58.160 --> 18:59.930
We've been searching for you!

18:59.930 --> 19:01.430
What were you doing?

19:03.400 --> 19:05.400
Huh? What is it? What are you saying?

19:07.500 --> 19:08.910
Akira, is your fever okay?

19:09.910 --> 19:11.010
I'm fine now!

19:12.640 --> 19:15.710
That dog is saying why he's here.

19:15.710 --> 19:16.580
Duke!

19:17.250 --> 19:18.820
It seems he was waiting for a ship.

19:19.250 --> 19:21.290
You can understand dogs?

19:21.620 --> 19:23.680
I'm a bilingual familiar.

19:28.660 --> 19:30.390
Hey, what is it, Hiroshi?

19:31.560 --> 19:33.250
Something with the ocean?

19:40.100 --> 19:40.870
A ferry...

19:53.550 --> 19:54.580
Pops!

19:57.990 --> 20:01.760
Oh, Akira, Hiroshi! You came to pick me up!

20:01.760 --> 20:03.090
That's really nice of you...

20:03.760 --> 20:09.670
Hiroshi, somehow you knew Pops would arrive
here, and you were waiting this whole time?

20:10.900 --> 20:17.370
Maybe Hiroshi wanted to bring your dad
back home as quickly as possible.

20:19.380 --> 20:20.570
Hiroshi...

20:21.950 --> 20:23.410
Why you...!

20:25.450 --> 20:27.480
Oh, that's a good shot!

20:39.830 --> 20:40.880
Welcome home, Pops!

20:41.600 --> 20:42.880
Yeah, I'm back.

20:43.300 --> 20:44.330
Growin' the beard, I see.

20:46.140 --> 20:48.170
Good for you, Akira.

20:48.170 --> 20:50.840
Kato... thanks.

20:59.380 --> 21:01.950
How pretty, it's a green colored heart.

21:02.490 --> 21:03.570
It's the first time I've seen one.

21:05.290 --> 21:07.760
A green colored heart is
a sign of friendship.

21:08.360 --> 21:10.580
It's worth more than an orange heart.

21:13.530 --> 21:14.800
Agrandissment!

21:15.170 --> 21:16.530
Sugar Sugar Rune!

21:16.530 --> 21:17.530
Choco Rune!

21:18.840 --> 21:22.130
Your heart, pick up!

21:32.080 --> 21:33.580
Good for you, Chocolat-chan.

21:39.960 --> 21:42.090
Everyone, thanks a lot for today.

21:42.090 --> 21:43.750
Now, eat up!

21:44.360 --> 21:46.160
It looks delicious.

21:46.160 --> 21:49.490
The special broth is crucial to the taste.

21:49.730 --> 21:51.070
This stuff's great!

21:55.040 --> 21:57.170
Here ya go, Hiroshi, don't burn yourself.

22:02.710 --> 22:04.380
A green heart, huh?

22:05.150 --> 22:07.520
For some reason, it makes me
happier than all the others.

22:09.250 --> 22:10.920
Thank you, Akira.

22:23.080 --> 22:29.390
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.520 --> 22:30.890
"Love"

22:31.830 --> 22:35.330
A magic spell.

22:37.500 --> 22:44.770
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.200 --> 22:54.280
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.950 --> 23:00.220
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.820 --> 23:03.890
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.190 --> 23:11.260
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.630 --> 23:16.070
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.070 --> 23:26.180
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.240 --> 23:35.090
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:47.710 --> 23:50.680
I wonder how Robin manages to collect all those hearts...

23:51.490 --> 23:54.620
Okay, today I'm gonna study Robin thoroughly!

23:55.010 --> 23:59.680
First making a present from the heart, next blowing a kiss...

24:00.470 --> 24:04.290
Then I'll be able to get piles of hearts, just like Robin!

24:05.490 --> 24:07.680
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.680 --> 24:10.270
Study Robin! The Great Love Strategy!

24:10.970 --> 24:12.890
If you don't watch, I'll whup your butt!

24:12.890 --> 24:13.820
Thanks!
